    "body": "Looking at the spec for inert: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#inert-subtrees\r\n\r\nThe 4 bullet points make the test as it is correct.\r\n\r\nHowever, in the following note, it says: \"Inert nodes that are commands will also get disabled.\", so this is basically up to: is checking a checkbox a command?",
