    "created_at": "2022-10-17T20:55:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-17T20:55:23Z",
    "body": "For text inputs, the note says inert elements cannot be focused, so that does mean clicking the label should fail to focus the text input.\r\n\r\nIt is definitely more ambiguous for other input types though.\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
