    "created_at": "2022-10-18T07:34:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-18T07:34:18Z",
    "body": "> The 4 bullet points make the test as it is correct.\r\n\r\nNothing says that clicking a label should click the form control, so the test is relying on undefined behavior. (This part has nothing to do with inert)",
